-lspの補完が昨日動かなくなり、最小構成でも動かないんですが、設定を間違えてるとかわかる方いませんか…\n```set rtp+=~/.cache/dein/repos/github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim\nset rtp+=~/.cache/dein/repos/github.com/Shougo/ddc.vim\nset rtp+=~/.cache/dein/repos/github.com/Shougo/ddc-nvim-lsp\nset rtp+=~/.cache/dein/repos/github.com/Shougo/ddc-around\nset rtp+=~/.cache/dein/repos/github.com/Shougo/ddc-matcher_head\nset rtp+=~/.cache/dein/repos/github.com/neovim/nvim-lspconfig\n\ncall ddc#custom#patch_global('sources', ['nvimlsp', 'around'])\ncall ddc#custom#patch_global('sourceOptions', {\n      \\ '_': { 'matchers': ['matcher_head'] },\n      \\ 'around': { 'mark': 'A' }, \n      \\ 'nvimlsp': { 'mark': 'lsp' },\n      \\ })\n\ncall ddc#enable()\n\nlua \u0026lt;\u0026lt; EOF\nrequire('lspconfig').vimls.setup{}\nEOF```","ts":"1630913875.151300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tCwq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"323df4da-c3e8-43a3-92e0-2f94796924ef","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"アットマークを全角にする -\u0026gt; 全角を半角にする拡張","ts":"1630912241.149200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Enqk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70a00af2-b1ef-48b9-a90c-03c1f4dfa45a","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"h抜きをリンクにするChrome拡張","ts":"1630912185.148700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FGP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EDCF5333-A2D9-40AD-A0AC-A50C3823C9C4","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"そこでh抜き","ts":"1630912135.148300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":3,"users":["U6XP9LZ6V","UDPT2BZ6E","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gub"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ff724b9-a56f-46fb-a124-262422501ede","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"（vim-win32-installer のメッセージ生成スクリプトを修正すべきだろうかというのを考えている）","ts":"1630912132.148100","team":"T03C4RC8V